<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela foreign reserve figure delayed.</title>
<headline>Venezuela foreign reserve figure delayed.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's Central Bank said it would not release its customary weekly foreign reserve figure Friday.</p>
<p>A bank spokeswoman said the reserve figures had been delayed until early next week due to the Carnival public holidays last Monday and Tuesday.</p>
<p>Foreign reserves stood at $15.529 billion on Feb. 3.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
